## Key Learnings

### 1. Reusable Skills Save Time

Creating a reusable workflow is more efficient than rewriting prompts repeatedly.

### 2. Consistent Frameworks Improve Research Quality

Every company is analyzed using the same structured methodology.

### 3. AI Can Act as a Research Assistant

Custom Skills transform Claude from a chatbot into a specialized research tool.

### 4. Systems Scale Better Than Individual Prompts

The most valuable AI workflows are reusable systems rather than one-time interactions.

